      "A Life of Faith, Love, and Joyful Fellowship with God’s People Tribute by Revd Meshack Salawu, Chaplain, UMCA Theological Seminary Chapel, Ilorin With gratitude to God for a life well spent, we pay tribute to our beloved Elder, Father, Baba, Grandfather, and Friend, Late Mr. Wesley Olajide Ojo Aiyegboka. His life testified to genuine Christian faith, love for God, and affection for His people.",
