      "You labored for us, you prayed for us, and you taught us to be content, truthful and hardworking. Your words of advice and your sincere prayers will continue to guide me for the rest of my life.",
      "Your death has created a big vacuum in my life and in the entire Aiyegboka family. I will greatly miss your fatherly love, your calls, your counsel and your smiling face.",
      "But I take solace in the Word of God that you have gone to rest in the bosom of our Lord Jesus Christ, where there is no more pain or sorrow.",
      "Thank you for being the best Daddy in the world. I will forever make you proud and keep your legacy alive. Rest on, my beloved Daddy, till we meet to part no more. Sun re o, Daddy mi owon!"
